        },
        {
          "text": " Kaany, ido koany, ebalasit loekwele, ekebwanenitonike da ekekiror Atwanare, kotupa ŋes Okatwak; koinakinai kes apolou kama katutubet nakiwoŋonet naka akwap, koarete kekileŋ, ka ebeli, ka atular, ka itiaŋ luededeŋ luka akwap.",
          "type": "text",
