        },
        {
          "text": " Kiworoto keporoto loepol ebe, “Ijo Ejakait, Lokalaunan, lokabeit, itodoli ai mam kitubokini, karaida ainyaŋ aokotokosi kama ejaas ŋul luiboiete kakwap?” ",
          "type": "text",
